{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","name":"Riemann.CCM.Native.native_determinant_ratio","type":"∀ {N : ℕ} (C : Riemann.CCM.Native.Coefficients N) (L : ℝ) (hL : 0 < L) (A : Riemann.CCM.Native.GroundAdmission C)\n  (z : ℂ),\n  (∀ (i : Riemann.CCM.Native.Index N), z ≠ ↑(Riemann.CCM.Native.frequency L i)) →\n    (Riemann.CCM.Native.boundaryMatrix L (Riemann.CCM.Native.fullData C L hL A).groundVector - z • 1).det /\n        (Riemann.CCM.Native.freeMatrix N L - z • 1).det =\n      -z *\n        ((↑√L)⁻¹ *\n          ∑ i, (Riemann.CCM.Native.fullData C L hL A).groundVector.ofLp i / (↑(Riemann.CCM.Native.frequency L i) - z))","unsafe":false}
